    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully upgraded three-bedroom home in a secluded corner of one of Dublin's most established and sought-after addresses.\r\n\r\nTucked away within the exclusive Temple Square development, No. 35 offers the rare combination of a quiet, private setting and exceptional city convenience. Extensively upgraded and presented in turnkey condition, it is a home designed for easy, comfortable living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and well presented, with a contemporary feel throughout. A welcoming hallway leads to a generous living room, while the heart of the home is the bright, modern kitchen and dining area. Well suited to both everyday living and entertaining, this generous space opens directly onto the garden, creating a natural connection between the interior and exterior. There is also a guest w.c and utility on the ground floor. The accommodation also includes three bedrooms and two bathrooms. \r\n\r\nPractical improvements throughout include new A-rated windows and doors, upgraded attic insulation, Dimplex Q-Rad heating and electric Velux windows with rain sensors.\r\n\r\nOutside, a low-maintenance garden is softened by mature trees and enhanced by discreet lighting, making it equally inviting by day and after dark. Side access adds further practicality to this carefully considered home.\r\n\r\nTemple Square occupies an enviable position off Temple Road, moments from Palmerston Park. The cafés and neighbourhood shops of Dunville Avenue are close at hand, while the Luas at Cowper and Milltown offers an easy connection to the city centre. No. 35 is a future-proofed home in a setting that feels remarkably peaceful for such a well-connected Dublin 6 address.\r\n\r\nAmenities on the doorstep inc Palmerston Park, the Luas and Iconic Health Club all within a five-minute stroll. With the park on your doorstep, the Luas at Cowper providing swift city access and Iconic Health Club offering a 15m pool, it offers a rare combination of green space, connectivity and wellbeing."
      },
